  "problem": "While hunting, a lioness accelerates from rest with a constant acceleration of $5\\,{\\text{m/s}}^{2}$ for the first $4$ seconds of her motion. Then, the lioness decelerates with a constant deceleration of $4\\,{\\text{m/s}}^{2}$ until she stops. Which graph represents the described motion?",
